><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"flex-col ng-star-inserted\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-faq class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"faq-section ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.lt-lg=\"column\" fxlayoutgap=\"20px grid\" fxlayoutgap.gt-lg=\"24px grid\"><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\" class=\"faq__title\"><h2 class=\"primary-heading ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"\">About the program</h2><!----><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-26 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-27 ng-tns-c1859850774-26 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Benefits\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-8\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-8\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-27\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-27\"> Benefits </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-27 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-26 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-8\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-8\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-26\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><ul>\n    <li>Guests with disabilities are eligible for a discount on their base fare on all cabin classes, for any Saudia domestic flight booked through the website.</li>\n    <li>Guests with disabilities are eligible for a discount on their base fare on all cabin classes, for any international flight booked through the sales office.</li>\n    <li>The Guests with Disability program is available to both Saudi citizens and residents.</li>\n    <li>If the passenger is traveling with a companion, the companion can also benefit from the same discount.</li>\n    <li>Passengers can enjoy a range of services available to them through the Saudia website like seat selection, purchase of  baggage and Wi-Fi vouchers, issuance of boarding passes, flight time enquiries and more.</li>\n</ul></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-28 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-29 ng-tns-c1859850774-28 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How it works\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-29\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-29\"> How it works </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-29 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-28 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-28\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><ul>\n<li>To benefit from the Guests with Disability program, we must first verify your eligibility. Please enter your national ID number and date of birth, or residence number and expiry date.</li>\n<li>To be eligible, the passenger must be\nregistered with the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Development database and have a qualifying and updated disability under his profile. If the passenger is not registered, a profile must be created through the E-services portal of the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Development, after which a request for a disability assessment service can be made through this link <a aria-label=\"click here to learn more about eservices\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://eservices.mlsd.gov.sa\">https://eservices.mlsd.gov.sa </a> <br> Once the request is approved, the passenger will be eligible and can request a reduction in fares\n</li></ul></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-30 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-31 ng-tns-c1859850774-30 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Terms and Conditions\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-10\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-10\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-31\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-31\"> Terms and Conditions </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-31 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-30 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-10\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-10\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-30\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><ul>\n    <li>The service is for Saudia guests with disabilities registered in The Ministry of Human Resource and Social Development's database. </li>\n    <li>The name of the beneficiary from the discount must be identical to the name on the reservation, and in case of non-conformity, Saudia has the right to cancel the reservation without incurring any financial or legal responsibility.</li>\n    <li>This service cannot be used with any other offer.</li>\n    <li>The companion can't benefit from the service without the beneficiary guest.</li>\n    <li>The price is valid for reservations purchased through the Saudia's website.</li>\n    <li>The service will not be accepted on code share flights and other airline flights.</li>\n    <li>Terms and conditions apply.</li>\n</ul></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"flex-col ng-star-inserted\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-image-link-list class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"custom-carousel h--right image--teaser mobile-text--top ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div appswiper=\"\" fxflex=\"auto\" class=\"swiper-container ng-star-inserted swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-backface-hidden\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"swiper-slide discover-our-summer ng-star-inserted swiper-slide-active\"><div fxlayout=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"\" fxflexfill=\"\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"swiper-slide__image desktop-view ng-sta