/span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-33 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-32 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-11\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-11\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-32\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><ul>\n    <li>\n    The discount rate is 50%. </li>\n    <li>Discount is applicable on Saudia domestic flights, according to the guests’ eligibility. </li>\n</ul></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-34 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-35 ng-tns-c1859850774-34 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How many passengers can I book for in one booking record through the website?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-12\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-12\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-35\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-35\"> How many passengers can I book for in one booking record through the website? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-35 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-34 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-12\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-12\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-34\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">You can book for the guest benefiting from the discount granted to people with disabilities, in addition to one companion only, in case that the guest wantes to add a companion.</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-36 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-37 ng-tns-c1859850774-36 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"What can the applicant do if there is no disability/disabilities due to him in his profile?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-13\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-13\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-37\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-37\"> What can the applicant do if there is no disability/disabilities due to him in his profile? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-37 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-36 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-13\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-13\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-36\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">A request for a disability assessment must be submitted through the electronic services website of the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Development through the link https://eservices.mlsd.gov.sa. The disability of the beneficiary has been classified from the due disabilities. After that, the applicant can request a reduction in fares.</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!---->